1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Prompt engineering was always a

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:03,220
little bit ridiculous,

3
00:00:03,660 --> 00:00:05,800
but context is king.

4
00:00:06,040 --> 00:00:08,380
You've got a window of at most a

5
00:00:08,380 --> 00:00:10,560
million tokens to tell your LLM

6
00:00:10,560 --> 00:00:11,760
everything it needs to know

7
00:00:11,760 --> 00:00:13,880
